#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:11
msgid ""
"Keep conversations in separate tabs, attach images to vision models, and "
"read responses with Markdown and highlighted code."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:12
msgid ""
"Manage hosts and models, customize generation and thinking settings, and "
"inspect response statistics including cached prompt tokens."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid ""
"Generate and validate structured JSON, import JSON schemas, and export "
"responses. Inspect loaded models and release their memory when finished."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:14
msgid ""
"Save and organize conversations with pinning and editable titles. Stop a "
"response at any time and keep its partial answer in your history."
msgstr ""

